// Buckler bomb detonation (ext8): frames only (a move with neither hits nor a shot needs a script to be valid content, and this one
// does nothing). The down special's own script calls detonate() on its first frame and goes on as this move, so the bomb bursts 12
// frames after the press (its blast's delay), on this move's frames 12-13 [R].
if frame < 0 {
    end();
}
